<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="sec-attribute-references">1. Attribute References</h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>The product is Widget. Undefined: {undefined-attr}. Escaped: {product}.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Redefined product: Gadget.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Unset product: {product}.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p> Dynamic attribute is value.
1 2 3&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;current 3.
a b  c.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Character replacements: &#160;&#8203;&<>&#43;&#166;|^~{apostrophe}\`::;;C&#43;&#43;&#43;&#43;.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Attribute with formatting: <a href="https://example.org/widget" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>bold link</strong></a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="sec-conditionals">2. Conditionals</h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Feature X is enabled.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Feature Y is not enabled.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Either X or Y is set.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Version is greater than four.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Backend is HTML5.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Empty attributes are still defined.</p>
</div>
